   146	|---|---|
   147	| `EllipticCurvePublicNumbers(...).public_key()` rejects an off-curve point | `TestLibraryBehaviour::test_LIB01_numbers_rejects_off_curve` |
   148	| It **accepts** X = x + p and reduces it to x | `test_LIB02_numbers_accepts_and_reduces_x_ge_p` |
